-- Burning Steppes: the quest hub NPCs and the invaders of the Cataclysm quests. Based on Legends of Azeroth 5.4.8,
-- checked against the spawn maps on Wowhead MoP Classic.
--
-- John J. Keeshan (Morgan's Vigil and the forward base), Colonel Troteman, Ariok and Eitrigg were not spawned, so the
-- Alliance quests from "Burning Vengeance" (28174) on and the Horde quests of the Flame Crest and Thorium Point
-- camps could not be taken. The 5.4.8 data has 515 sniffed Blackrock Invaders for "Assault on Dreadmaul Rock" (28320,
-- 28454, 200 kills), Wowhead shows 51 spots: 133 are placed here, spread over the sniffed area. The Scorpid, Worg and
-- Obsidian Elemental drops of "Stocking Up", "A Future Project" and the Obsidian Ashes quests had no rows.

